 "notes": [
  "Codes are Formly's: the page names an input formly_<n>_<kind>_<code>_<k>; n and k change per session, the code does not.",
  "ATT_STRUTTIPO, ATT_STRUTCATEG and ATT_MUNICIPAL have no options until the classification or the address is chosen.",
  "The street and civic number are two address-search inputs with no field code.",
  "ATT_SCELTAPERS (Persona Fisica or Persona Giuridica) changes the fields of step 2: only the Persona Fisica set was read. The manual lists a Persona Giuridica set (fiscal data, registered office, administrative address, legal representative and their residence).",
  "The manual adds a mandatory ID document image upload (step 5, 'Documentazione obbligatoria') and a summary and send step; neither has form fields to read.",
  "The privacy checkbox is the person's own consent and the Send button theirs: a run never ticks or presses either."
 ]
